{"id":"merabeat-the-johnny","nome_en":"Merabeat the Johnny","nome_jp":"メラビート・ザ・ジョニー","nome_it":"","civilta":["Fire"],"costo":7,"potere":"10000","potere_num":10000,"tipo":"Creature","razze":["Jokers"],"testo":"Speed Attacker Double Breaker\n■ Master Double Merabeat: When you summon this creature in the battle zone, put up to 2 creatures that have the \"Jokers Over Explode\" ability from your hand into the battle zone. At the end of your turn, put them on the bottom of your deck in any order, then draw a card for each creature you put on the bottom of your deck this way.\n■ When you put this creature, if you have 5 or more Jokers in the battle zone, destroy all your opponent's creatures.","testo_jp":"Speed Attacker Double Breaker\n■ マスター・W・メラビート：このクリーチャーが召喚によってバトルゾーンに出た時、「J・O・E」能力を持つクリーチャーを2体まで、自分の手札からバトルゾーンに出す。このターンの終わりに、それらを好きな順序で自分の山札の一番下に置き、その後、こうして下に置いたクリーチャー1体につき、カードを1枚引く。\n■ このクリーチャーが出た時、バトルゾーンに自分のジョーカーズが5体以上あれば、相手のクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。","mana":null,"set_code":"DMRP-03","set_nome":"Feeling Joejoe Meraventure!!","rarita":"Master Card","numero":"M1/M1","formato":"OCG","illustratori":["YOICHI ITO"],"url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmasters/images/d/d5/Dmex19-m35.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220722153622","url_wiki":"https://duelmasters.fandom.com/wiki/Merabeat_the_Johnny","varianti":[{"set_code":"DMEX-19","set_nome":"Master Final Memorial Pack","numero":"M35/M40","rarita":"Master Card","formato":"OCG","url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmasters/images/d/d5/Dmex19-m35.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220722153622"},{"set_code":"DMRP-03","set_nome":"Feeling Joejoe Meraventure!!","numero":"M1/M1","rarita":"Master Card","formato":"OCG","url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmasters/images/5/51/Dmrp3-m1.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200126234943"},{"set_code":"DMRP-03","set_nome":"Feeling Joejoe Meraventure!!","numero":"M1㊙1/M1\n (Secret Card)","rarita":"Master Card","formato":"OCG","url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmas